-- Enquiry to admission (docs/designs/enquiry/enquiry.md): one merged enquiry (DD-1), its follow-up log (DD-8), the
-- path, type and status masters (DD-4), guards for the enrolment rules (DD-6, DD-15), RLS by centre, definer functions
-- for counsellors, seeds and permissions. The DDL down to the foreign keys was generated by prisma migrate diff;
-- everything after it is hand-written (checks and triggers are invisible to the drift gate).

